# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Libris Mobile App (Flutter) — Environment Configuration
# Compile-time constants configured via --dart-define flags
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# During development or release builds, specify the configuration values
# using Flutter's --dart-define build flags:

# Development run with local backend:
# flutter run \
#   --dart-define=BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:5000 \
#   --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co \
#   --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# Production release build:
# flutter build apk --release \
#   --dart-define=BACKEND_URL=https://your-api.production-domain.com \
#   --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co \
#   --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# Defaults in AppConfig:
# BACKEND_URL:
#   - Debug: http://localhost:5000 (auto-redirects to 10.0.2.2 on Android emulator)
#   - Release: https://book-ai-app-libris-api.onrender.com
# SUPABASE_URL: Configured project endpoint
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Configured project anon public key
